Date: Tue, 29 Jul 2025 14:05:17 -0700
Subject: [PATCH 018/190] drm: xlnx: mmi-dc: Implement flexible overlay

commit 9724909c42d0ddd3596909d5b47e382149e2f8e9 from
https://github.com/Xilinx/linux-xlnx.git xlnx_rebase_v6.12

Implement overlay plane cropping and positioning. Check and drive DMA from
framebuffer dimensions.

Note: overlay plane can't go offscreen in top or left directions due to HW
compositor constraints.

